%% Use Case 2: Create or Join Group, join path (Requirements_and_Design.md section 4.6)
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant FE as Front-end
    participant UG as Users & Groups
    participant DB as MongoDB

    M->>FE: tap "Join group"
    FE-->>M: invite code form ("Join" disabled while the code is blank)
    M->>FE: enter invite code, tap "Join"
    FE->>UG: POST /api/groups/join {inviteCode} + session token
    alt device cannot reach the server
        FE-->>M: "Network error: ..." (stays on the form)
    else request reaches the server
        UG->>UG: normalize the code to upper case
        UG->>DB: find group by invite code
        alt no group has this code
            UG-->>FE: 404 "Invalid invite code"
            FE-->>M: show error, member may enter another code
        else group found
            UG->>DB: add caller to members, only if not already a member
            alt caller is already a member
                UG-->>FE: 409 "Already a member of this group"
                FE-->>M: show error
            else caller added
                UG-->>FE: 200 Group
                FE->>UG: GET /api/groups/:groupId
                UG-->>FE: 200 GroupDetail
                FE->>UG: GET /api/groups/:groupId/meetups
                UG-->>FE: 200 List of Meetup
                FE-->>M: group page with all members and meetups
            end
        end
    end
